Key: triangular lattice gives 47 at N=21; the PROVEN maximum is 57 (gap 10).
     => triangular/Eisenstein single-norm lattice is NOT optimal at N=21.
     The elementary cherry bound (71) is far above 57: AMP24 needed heavy
     forbidden-subgraph + embedding machinery to close it.

